{"ID":"20240118151058-h5acwup","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151058-h5acwup","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151058-h5acwup\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151058-q6h3zti\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122140959-zanl0k1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122140959-zanl0k1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:69,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:69\u0026#125;","title":"237海螵蛸（乌贼鱼骨）","type":"doc","updated":"20240202092914"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151058-q6h3zti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151058-q6h3zti","updated":"20240122140936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，微温，无毒。治女子漏下赤白经汁，血闭，阴蚀肿痛，寒热，惊气，症瘕，无子，生东海、池泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140939-c8q3krb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140939-c8q3krb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产于海滨，形如革囊，骨及肉入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140941-e59kg7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140941-e59kg7l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸，性微温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140943-fjsebtd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140943-fjsebtd","updated":"20240122140946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】乌贼骨主通经络，祛寒湿，治寒热症瘕，阴蚀肿痛，赤白漏下，血枯经闭，能补肝伤疗血不足。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140945-f5a8cxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140945-f5a8cxy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】惊气入腹，腹痛环脐，丈夫阴中肿痛，令人有子，又止疮多脓汁不燥。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140948-zsl2nww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140948-zsl2nww"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】疗血崩，杀虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140950-1uetnvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140950-1uetnvv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140951-2x3p3zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140951-2x3p3zp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】血病多热者勿用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140952-8hvfb96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140952-8hvfb96"}},{"ID":"20240122140952-1a9sa5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140952-1a9sa5m"}},{"ID":"20240122140952-3udij8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140952-3udij8x"}},{"ID":"20240122140937-83vxq7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140937-83vxq7v","updated":"20240202092833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"237呢，我们叫乌贼鱼骨，过去叫乌贼鱼骨。写乌贼鱼骨药房不知道，叫海螵蛸。白白一块拿出来，乌贼不是白白的一个，很大的乌贼白白的一个像船一样，应该不像船像冲浪板。拿出来一片白色的，就是乌贼鱼骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240122140959-zanl0k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140959-zanl0k1","updated":"20240202092914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌贼鱼骨我们使用的时机，大部分用在男人的睾丸有问题或是阴茎有问题，女人月经有问题，女人子宫太冷，能够通经。那补剂上面呢，补肝脏。它能补肝。任何东西只要补肝的都能明目，因为肝开窍在眼睛嘛。都可以明目。乌贼骨本身味道咸味。微温，没有毒性的。通经络，补肝凉血。一般来说晒干后很轻的，一钱两钱都可以用。这个乌贼鱼骨就是海螵蛸。诸位知道桑螵蛸是螳螂的窝是补肾的。"}]}]}